so insights are always accessible, supporting faster decisions and more effective growth.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n\n        <div class=\"child-c cc3\">\n          <h3>Omnichannel Integration<\/h3>\n          <p>Consistency matters across every sales channel. Our eCommerce website development approach includes omnichannel integration, connecting your store with mobile, social, and offline systems. This ensures customers have a seamless experience, no matter how they shop. We align all systems in real time to keep inventory, promotions, and customer data unified, helping your business operate smoothly and deliver a dependable brand experience.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n\n        <div class=\"child-c cc4\">\n          <h3>Automated Marketing Tools<\/h3>\n          <p>Automated campaigns keep customers engaged without constant manual effort. In our custom eCommerce website development, we include tools for cart recovery, product suggestions, and behavior-based messaging. These features help increase retention and sales. Many of these functions are supported through our broader web development services, ensuring your store runs efficiently while adapting to your business needs.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<script>\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {\n        const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.tab');\n        const contents = document.querySelectorAll('.child-c');\n\n        function clearActiveStates() {\n            tabs.forEach(tab => tab.classList.remove('scrolled'));\n            contents.forEach(content => content.classList.remove('active'));\n        }\n\n        tabs.forEach((tab, index) => {\n            tab.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                clearActiveStates();\n                tab.classList.add('scrolled');\n                contents[index].classList.add('active');\n            });\n        });\n\n        \/\/ Optional: Highlight the visible tab on scroll\n        wi