ntent-1972\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-labelledby=\"what-is-the-best-ecommerce-platform-for-my-business\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The best platform depends on your business size, goals, and scalability needs. Shopify, Magento, and custom-built solutions each offer distinct advantages. At Digital Software Labs, we help identify and implement the right platform based on your operational requirements and future growth plans.<\/span><\/p><\/div>\n                <\/div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n                <div id=\"how-long-does-it-take-to-build-an-ecommerce-solution\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1973\"><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How long does it take to build an eCommerce solution?<\/span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119 8 8 119 8 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S393 8 256 8zm144 276c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12h-92v92c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12h-56c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-92h-92c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-56c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h92v-92c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h56c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v92h92c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v56z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1973\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-labelledby=\"how-long-does-it-take-to-build-an-ecommerce-solution\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Development timelines vary based on complexity. A basic store may take 4\u20136 weeks, while advanced or custom eCommerce website development projects can take several months. We provide detailed timelines after project scoping and strategy alignment.<\/span><\/p><\/div>\n                <\/div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n                <div id=\"do-you-offer-custom-ecommerce-website-design-and-enterprise-solutions\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-